#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-album.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Album Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-album.docbook:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Icon-View Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This view permit to customize the album icon-view contents and the behavior "
"with user actions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show filename</guilabel> option show the filename below the "
"image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show file size</guilabel> option show the file size below the "
"image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show camera creation date</guilabel> option show the camera "
"creation date below the image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show file modification date</guilabel> option show the file "
"modification date below the image thumbnail if it's different than camera "
"creation date. This option is useful to identify quickly which items have "
"been modified."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:35
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show image dimensions</guilabel> option show the image size in "
"pixels below the image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show image aspect ratio</guilabel> option show the image "
"aspect ratio below the image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show image format</guilabel> option show image mime-type over "
"image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show digiKam title</guilabel> option show the digiKam title "
"below the image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show digiKam captions</guilabel> option show the digiKam "
"captions below the image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show digiKam tags</guilabel> option show the digiKam tags list "
"below the image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show digiKam rating</guilabel> option show the digiKam rating "
"below the image thumbnail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show rotation overlay buttons</guilabel> option show overlay "
"buttons over the image thumbnail to be able to process left or right image "
"rotation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show fullscreen overlay button</guilabel> option show an "
"overlay button over the image thumbnail to open it in fullscreen mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show Geolocation Indicator</guilabel> option show an icon over "
"the image thumbnail if item has geolocation information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Thumbnail click action</guilabel> option permit to choose what "
"should happen when you click on a thumbnail. Two settings are avaialble: "
"<guilabel>Show embedded view</guilabel> to display image in preview mode "
"(F3) or <guilabel>Start image editor</guilabel> top open image in a "
"separated window (F4)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Icon View font</guilabel> option permit to select the font "
"used to display text in icon-views."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Use large thumbnail size for high screen resolution</guilabel> "
"option render icon-view with large thumbnail size, for example in case of 4K "
"monitor is used. By default this option is turned off and the maximum "
"thumbnail size is limited to 256x256 pixels. When this option is enabled, "
"thumbnail size can be extended to 512x512 pixels. This option will store "
"more data in thumbnail database and will use more system memory. &digikam; "
"needs to be restarted to take effect, and <link linkend=\"tool-maintenance-"
"features-thumbs\">Rebuild Thumbnails</link> option from Maintenance tool "
"needs to be processed over whole collections."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-album.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Folder View Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:92 using-setup-album.docbook:109
#: using-setup-album.docbook:130 using-setup-album.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "TODO"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-album.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Album View Preview Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Click action</guilabel> can be set to <guilabel>Show embedded "
"preview</guilabel> or <guilabel>Start image editor</guilabel>. You herewith "
"define the default behavior of &digikam; when you click on an image item in "
"the main view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-album.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Album View Full-Screen Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-album.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Album Mime Type Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&digikam; can understand lots of different image file types as well as some "
"video and audio formats. To control which types of files &digikam; will try "
"to display you can add or remove file extensions from these lists. Any files "
"that are in the &digikam; Album folders that do not match these extensions "
"will be ignored by &digikam;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-album.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The default settings can be easily restored by clicking on the update "
"buttons to the right of each category."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-album.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Album Categories Settings"
msgstr ""

